Error [E0080]: This named function body follows an arrow instead of braces.
  --> tests/ui/one_arrow_function_body.jet:1:30
    |
  1 | fn double(value: Int) -> Int -> value * 2
    |                              ^^
 Why: A named function has one arrow, `->` or `-[Effects]>`, followed by its optional return type; the body always sits in braces: `fn name(...) -> Type { … }`.
 Fix: Replace `-> expr` with `{ expr }`; `jet fmt` applies this fix.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0080

